      "id": "p1",
      "text": "The casting of an actress in a major mythic adaptation has ignited a painful public debate, turning a story meant for all into a flashpoint over identity and belonging. Voices arguing for diverse casting see it as a sincere belief in shared stories for healing, while harmful accusations from media professionals have caused disillusionment and broken trust in the digital space.",
